      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block_1",
          "text": "Judges 19\u201321 presents escalating warfare, sexual violence, collective punishment, and forced wife-taking as evidence of social collapse, not as moral patterns to imitate. The desperate measures in Judges 21 belong to that closing portrayal.",
