          "interpretation_level": "disputed"
        },
        {
          "id": "block_2",
          "text": "The book\u2019s larger movement runs from incomplete possession and covenant indictment through recurring deliverance stories to internal idolatry, atrocity, and civil war. The events of Judges 21 therefore stand at the end of a widening breakdown within Israel.",
