      "title": "The Closing Refrain",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "block_4",
          "text": "The final statement, \u201cthere was no king in Israel,\u201d repeatedly connects the absence of a king with people doing what seemed right in their own eyes. It raises a question about kingship, but the refrain alone does not endorse every form of monarchy; it must be read with the wider biblical portrayals of kingship in view.",
